| `PolyEncoder::encode_bytes_base` | `PolyEncoder.encode_bytes_base_loop.body` | Encoding initialization path affected |

These `sorry` instances mean that **verification of these functions
and their transitive dependents cannot be completed** without first
resolving the extraction issues (either by fixing Aeneas or by
providing manual Lean definitions for the loop bodies).

